Package: dwarfs-tools
Architecture: amd64 arm64
Depends: fuse3, ${misc:Depends}
Description: command-line tools for DwarFS filesystems
 DwarFS is a high-compression, read-only filesystem. This package provides
 command wrappers for the upstream universal binary's dwarfs, dwarfsck,
 dwarfsextract, and mkdwarfs tools.
